  {
    "label": "1a3aec82-ec8f-58f2-b9b2-fdff35886aa6",
    "record": {
      "knowledge_point": {
        "db_id": 17592186105733,
        "id": "7c30217a-484c-5c31-a2bf-413f04e0edea",
        "title": "Calculating the Area of a Triangle Given Its Vertices"
      },
      "question": {
        ":question/id": "1a3aec82-ec8f-58f2-b9b2-fdff35886aa6",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate the area of the $△\\,ABC$, if $A(-4,-3,-4)$, $B(-9,1,-10)$, $C(-5,-5,-11).$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "First, we find the vectors $\\overset{\\to }{AB}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AC}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =b-a \\\\  & =(-9i+j-10k)-(-4i-3j-4k) \\\\  & =-5i+4j-6k \\\\  & =⟨-5,4,-6⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =c-a \\\\  & =(-5i-5j-11k)-(-4i-3j-4k) \\\\  & =-i-2j-7k \\\\  & =⟨-1,-2,-7⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the formula to compute the cross product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\times \\overset{\\to }{AC} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -5 & 4 & -6 \\\\ -1 & -2 & -7\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & -6 \\\\ -2 & -7\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-5 & -6 \\\\ -1 & -7\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-5 & 4 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(4\\cdot (-7)-(-6)\\cdot (-2))i-((-5)\\cdot (-7)-(-6)\\cdot (-1))j+((-5)\\cdot (-2)-4\\cdot (-1))k \\\\  & =-40i-29j+14k \\\\  & =⟨-40,-29,14⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{AB}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{AC}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\overset{\\to }{AB}\\times \\overset{\\to }{AC}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-40)^{2}+(-29)^{2}+{14}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2637} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{293}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of $△\\,ABC$ is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{3\\sqrt{293}}{2}.\n$$",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
          {
            ":answer-field/id": "686b4b88-2dcc-5887-a216-28891d2ec098",
            ":answer-field/key": "selection",
